2. Construct the momentum signal (MOM) monthly for the firms with data available in CRSP, by using the dataset "Q3_Datasets/CRSP_monthly.csv"
3. MOM for a stock at the end of month τ refers to the cumulative stock return from month \tau−12 to month \tau−1.
